00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:35.950
And this data is not indexed.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:37.116
It's like a flat file.

00:17:37.116 --> 00:17:38.032
FELIPE HOFFA: Exactly.

00:17:38.032 --> 00:17:40.040
You get pretty fast
results with small files,

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:45.020
